      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B00.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 4.31
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "recap",
      "narration_text": "Last week, I found that one universal confidence score can't capture environmental uncertainty. This week, I continued my literature review.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B01_Recap",
        "visual_intent": "Week 1 takeaway leads into week 2.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B01.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 9.92
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "literature review",
      "narration_text": "I read Identifying Uncertainty in Environmental Risk Assessments: The Development of a Novel Typology and Its Implications for Risk Characterization, by Skinner, Rocks, Pollard and Drew, published in Human and Ecological Risk Assessment in twenty fourteen.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B02_Paper",
        "visual_intent": "Citation card for paper 2.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B02.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 17.79
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "paper question",
      "narration_text": "It tackles a practical challenge: how do we systematically identify where uncertainty exists within a risk assessment, rather than treating it as one general limitation?",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B03_Question",
        "visual_intent": "Where in the assessment does uncertainty live?",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B03.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.65
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "the problem",
      "narration_text": "Existing uncertainty classifications were often overlapping, inconsistent, subjective, and not designed for environmental risk assessments.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B04_Problem",
        "visual_intent": "Four problems with existing classifications.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B04.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 9.79
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "method",
      "narration_text": "To address this, the researchers analyzed one hundred seventy one peer reviewed environmental risk assessments, using a weight of evidence approach.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B05_Method",
        "visual_intent": "171 assessments analysed, weight of evidence.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B05.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 9.13
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "result",
      "narration_text": "From that analysis, they developed a new typology: seven categories of uncertainty, and twenty subcategories.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B06_Typology",
        "visual_intent": "7 categories, 20 subcategories.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B06.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 7.23
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "the seven types",
      "narration_text": "First, data uncertainty: limits in the quality, availability, or relevance of data. Language uncertainty: ambiguity in terms, descriptions, or interpretation. And system uncertainty: limits in understanding the environmental system itself.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B07_Types1",
        "visual_intent": "Types 1–3 on the typology board.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B07.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 17.32
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B08",
      "act": "the seven types",
      "narration_text": "Extrapolation uncertainty: applying findings beyond the conditions where they were established. And variability: differences that come from natural variation in environmental systems.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B08_Types2",
        "visual_intent": "Types 4–5 on the typology board.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B08.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 12.2
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B09",
      "act": "the seven types",
      "narration_text": "Model uncertainty: limits of the models used to represent or predict conditions. And decision uncertainty: uncertainty in choosing or deciding based on the risk assessment.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B09_Types3",
        "visual_intent": "Types 6–7; board complete.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B09.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 11.75
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B10",
      "act": "implication",
      "narration_text": "The authors also linked uncertainty types to management techniques. The lesson: identify uncertainty by its source and nature, because different uncertainties need different approaches.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B10_Manage",
        "visual_intent": "Different types need different approaches.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B10.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 11.43
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B11",
      "act": "insight",
      "narration_text": "For my research, this gives a practical foundation for examining environmental E S G reports with A I. Take a company's water consumption.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B11_Water",
        "visual_intent": "An ESG water-consumption figure.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B11.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 9.77
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B12",
      "act": "insight",
      "narration_text": "The uncertainty may not simply be that data are missing. The data might be incomplete, based on extrapolation, calculated with an uncertain methodology, or reported at a scale that doesn't represent the facility.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B12_WaterTypes",
        "visual_intent": "Four different uncertainties behind one number.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B12.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 13.46
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B13",
      "act": "insight",
      "narration_text": "So our A I system could be evaluated on whether it identifies the type of uncertainty present, instead of simply saying low confidence.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
      "shot": {
        "type": "MANIM",
        "source": "manim",
        "manim": "scenes.py::B13_Evaluate",
        "visual_intent": "From 'low confidence' to a named type.",
        "show": []
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B13.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 8.49
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "BHTF",
      "act": "your turn",
      "narration_text": "Your turn. Next time you see an E S G number, ask what type of uncertainty sits behind it.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "af_bella",
